  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Fish Catch Data from the Eastern Bering Sea by the F/V Sea Storm during the Summer and Fall 2003",
  "description": "Salmon and pelagic nekton catch data were collected in the eastern Bering Sea by the U.S. F/V Sea Storm from August to October 2003. A pelagic rope trawl that was towed with the headrope at the surface (0 m; 1 hr at 3.5-5.0 knots) was used to sample 151stations.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To collect fish catch data as part of the BASIS survey of the Bering Sea.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23569232",
